PRIMARY POSITIVE
A persistence-gated structural controller can distinguish:

brief off-manifold novelty

from

persistent reusable structure

without receiving:
- a regime label;
- an event-duration forecast;
- a semantic permanence flag.

It asks only:

HAS THIS EXTRA STRUCTURAL VALUE REMAINED POSITIVE LONG ENOUGH?

This is the structural-memory counterpart of H5.

